{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"summary\": \"他从一开始就想通过亲密获得接纳和安全，却又害怕交付自己会失去判断与选择的自主权；在真实的满足、失去的恐惧、反复求证和尝试独立的过程中，他逐渐看清亲密与自由各自的价值和局限，最终学会承认自己的渴望、主动选择生活，并承担选择带来的风险。到了结尾，他不再要求幸福必须永久确定、毫无缺憾，能够珍惜眼前的亲密，也保有自己的判断；但未来是否会失去、自己是否会再次动摇，以及亲密与独立之间的矛盾，都没有得到彻底解决。\",\n  \"answers\": {\n    \"1\": \"C\",\n    \"2\": \"A\",\n    \"3\": \"D\",\n    \"4\": \"B\",\n    \"5\": \"A\",\n    \"6\": \"C\"\n  },\n  \"one_thing\": 7,\n  \"fill_in\": 1\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "26d25f26-d4cd-45c3-893c-36f7a67e491d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261021T070410700247Z", "elapsed_seconds": 11.25, "completed_utc": "2026-10-21T07:04:21.965813+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "74e6505779793036f95e3bae65d7d898079535508b613d82aa38aab64ce98eb7", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "722a90984d40295e55caba596589f01b85b2b784e2b74dd51fb8de09bf479560", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee5